{"title":"比一比算一算","authors":[],"dates":[{"year":1954,"month":1,"day":12}],"is_range_date":false,"parts":[{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"政府举办农业贷款，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帮助农民解决困难；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"奸商‘帮忙’非真心，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高利贷剥削人；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"余粮卖给合作社，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"支持了国家大建设；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"杀价收买真狠心，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花言巧语欺农民；"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合作社运来大批工业品，生产更有劲，社会主义有保证!"},{"type":"paragraph","text":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洪荒"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"粮食到手高价卖，"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"唯利是图害死人。"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"洪荒　作"}],"comments":[],"origin":"","comment_pivots":[],"description":"","page_start":1,"page_end":1,"alias":""}